(38,	'Aly Chiman',	'aly1@alychidesigns.com',	'{\"1\":{\"type\":\"name\",\"label\":\"Your Name\",\"value\":\"Aly Chiman\"},\"2\":{\"type\":\"email\",\"label\":\"Your Email\",\"value\":\"aly1@alychidesigns.com\"},\"3\":{\"type\":\"select\",\"label\":\"Topic\",\"value\":\"Make any field required or not\"},\"4\":{\"type\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\"Message\",\"value\":\"Hello there,[~nr~][~nl~][~nr~][~nl~]My name is Aly and I would like to know if you would have any interest to have your website here at journal-theme.com promoted as a resource on our blog alychidesign.com ?[~nr~][~nl~][~nr~][~nl~]We are in the midst of updating our do-follow broken link resources to include current and up to date resources for our readers. [~nr~][~nl~].[~nr~][~nl~]If you may be interested please in being included as a resource on our blog, please let me know.[~nr~][~nl~][~nr~][~nl~]Thanks,[~nr~][~nl~]Aly\"}}',	0,	'',	'2019-04-09 15:21:21'),
