le=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">1. In addition to the contractual legal relationship created by viewing the page, in the case of a purchase in the Webshop, a sales contract is created between the buyer-user and the Operator as Seller, which legal relationship is governed by the order and confirmation as well as the provisions of these GTC. The online store is obliged to confirm the customer\'s order within 48 hours, failing which the customer is released from his obligation to make an offer.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">2. By sending the order, the customer accepts the terms of the sales contract. After completing the order in full and checking the entered data, the contract is created as follows:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">3. In case of delivery: Upon receipt of the informative email sent by the Seller, in which the Buyer is notified of the delivery of the package to the courier service, the expected date of delivery or collection.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">4. Orders are automatically stored in electronic form by Web\\u00e1ruh\\u00e1z, and the customer can review them later. Parties to the CVIII of 2001 on certain issues of electronic commercial services and services related to the information society. in accordance with the provisions of the law, they agree that the contract concluded through an order placed in the Webshop is considered to be concluded in writing, the contract is concluded in Hungarian, and it is governed by Hungarian law. The provisions of these GTC apply to the contract. Upon request, the Seller will send a copy of the order in electronic form, knowing the order number. Given that the contract is considered a written contract, the parties agree that communication between the Operator and the customer at the email address included in the customer\'s registration or order data is considered written communication. The e-mail confirmation of the order constitutes the content of the contract between the Operator and the user, and sending it by e-mail complies with Art. 45\\/2014. (II. 26.) of the \\\"written confirmation\\\" requirement according to \\u00a7 18 of the Government Decree. Please read these documents and keep them. Contact our customer service if you have any questions. Orders can be placed on the online interface of the Webshop. The Operator can accept and fulfill an order placed in the Web Store only if the customer fills out the fields on the registration and\\/or purchase page in full. The Webstore assumes no responsibility for damages resulting from failure to do so, or for technical problems arising during the process. Shipping or other additional costs incurred in the event of incorrect or insufficiently detailed addressing or other data and information shall be borne by the customer. Technical options for correcting data entry errors: it is possible to correct data entry errors at the end of the purchase process, before pressing the \\\"Order\\\" button that appears after selecting the payment method, i.e. you have the option to change the data you entered during the order before finalizing the order (the clicking the back button in the browser opens the previous page, so the entered data can be corrected even if you have already moved to the next page). Please note that it is your responsibility to ensure that the data you provide is entered accurately, as the product will be invoiced and delivered based on the data you provided. With your order, you acknowledge that the Operator is entitled to charge you for all damages and costs resulting from your incorrect data entry and inaccurate data. The Operator excludes responsibility for performance based on inaccurate data entry. We would like to draw your attention to the fact that an incorrectly entered e-mail address or the saturation of the storage space belonging to the mailbox may result in the lack of delivery of the confirmation and prevent the conclusion of the contract. The contents of the \\\"Basket\\\" can be checked, changed or even deleted at any time. In the event of a data entry error detected after the order has been sent, this must be reported immediately to the email address hello@aromacenter.hu.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">5. It is important to indicate the exact contact information by phone, because in many cases the Webstore will consult by phone or send an SMS before delivery. In case of incomplete contact information, the Seller will not fulfill the order.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">6. When browsing the Webstore, you can add individual products to the virtual cart by clicking on the \\\"Add to cart\\\" function on the page of the selected products you want to purchase. After selecting the products, the actual ordering process can be started by clicking on the \\\"Basket\\\" button, and after entering the delivery address, delivery and payment methods, the order can be finalized and sent.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">If you are convinced that the contents of the basket correspond to the products you want to order, and that your information is correct, you can complete your order by clicking the \\\"Order\\\" button. The information provided on the website does not constitute an offer to conclude a contract on the part of the Service Provider. In the case of orders falling under the scope of these GTC, you are considered to be the offeror.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">By pressing the \\\"Order\\\" button, you expressly acknowledge that your offer must be considered as made, and that your statement - in the event of confirmation by the Service Provider in accordance with these General Terms and Conditions - entails a payment obligation. You are bound by your offer for a period of 48 hours. If your offer is not confirmed by the Service Provider within 48 hours according to these general terms and conditions, you will be released from your obligation to make an offer.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">7. We would like to draw your attention to the fact that each finalized order is treated as a separate order by the Webshop system, so orders placed directly one after the other to the same customer and address will be shipped in a separate package, in which case the delivery fee will be charged separately for each order. If you have already placed your order, but would like to add new products to the package, please contact customer service immediately, so the order can still be modified depending on the status of the order, i.e. before the package is handed over to the courier service.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">8. It is necessary to register before the first purchase in the Webshop, and in the case of subsequent orders, you must log in to the already created registration account. Registration makes it easier to purchase later and take advantage of possible discounts. Before finalizing the registration, it is also necessary to accept the registration conditions. The system will confirm the registration by e-mail. The customer is obliged to keep the password he provides confidential. If the customer\'s unique identifier and password were correctly entered during the identification, the customer\'s data fell into the possession of an unauthorized third party, the Data Controller does not assume responsibility for the resulting damages or disadvantages. By entering their e-mail address, users consent to the operator\\/service provider sending them technical messages. The operator deletes the registered data from the system upon request. For security reasons, the deletion request will only be valid if the deletion request is confirmed by the user by e-mail, so that it can be avoided that someone intentionally or mistakenly deletes something else from the registration database. Registration is identified by the e-mail address, so an e-mail address can only be registered once. Registration does not entail any obligations. If you do not wish to register for your order, you can continue shopping according to the option of purchasing without registration, in which case you will only provide your data for the one-time purchase. In this case, the necessary data must be entered again at each purchase.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">9. The prices shown on the site are always the gross prices plus VAT , unless VAT is indicated separately. The gross prices include the general sales tax of the amount specified in the legislation in force at the time of purchase for the given range of products. The prices indicated in the Webshop are valid until withdrawn or changed. Product images and stock information in the Webshop are informative and may differ from reality. Due to the rapid changes in stock, in exceptional cases some products may be listed as \\\"in stock\\\" even though they are not actually in stock. The Web Store assumes no responsibility for such errors, and will inform the customer after the error has been identified.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">10. The Seller is obliged to deliver the products ordered by you to the delivery address indicated in the order, according to the conditions contained in these GTC and the order confirmation.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">11. The user can receive the product at the address specified at the time of the order, and can pay the purchase price of the product and the indicated additional costs (e.g. delivery, cash on delivery fee) in accordance with the terms and conditions of these GTC at the same time as or before delivery.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">14. Payment methods<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">\\u2022 Fulfillment in person: In this case, you pay the purchase price of the product in forints at the Operator\'s headquarters\\/site, either in cash or by bank card.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">\\u2022 Payment by bank card is possible for holders of the following valid and effective bank cards: Mastercard , Maestro, Visa<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">\\u2022 Delivery by cash on delivery: The product is delivered by the Foxpost, Packeta , F\\u00e1ma Courier or GLS courier service commissioned by us to the address specified by you, where the price of the product or products according to the invoice must be paid to the courier in cash. In the case of a cash on delivery order, the cash on delivery fee is added to the delivery cost.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">\\u2022 In case of payment by cash on delivery, the ordered product must be paid in cash to the delivery person upon receipt of the package.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">The final amount to be paid includes all costs based on the summary of the order and the confirmation letter. The invoice and warranty card are included in the package. Upon delivery, please inspect the package before the delivery person, and in case of damage or missing products, ask for a report and do not accept the package. We are unable to accept subsequent complaints without a protocol.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">12. The Webstore provides discounted shopping opportunities in the form of coupons on certain occasions or periods chosen by it. In the case of coupon sales, it is also possible to pay the purchase price of the product in whole or in part by entering the coupon data on the internet interface. The coupon code must be entered in the appropriate field at the Cart within the validity period and in accordance with its terms of use. Only one coupon can be redeemed per order, coupons cannot be combined. Other details of the terms of use of the coupons are contained in the terms of the current coupon promotion.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">13. Methods of receipt:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">14. The ordered products will be delivered to the specified address by courier service at the customer\'s choice.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">15. In the case of delivery by courier - if the chosen product( s ) are in stock - the customer can choose a delivery time during the order. In other cases, you will be notified by email or phone about the expected delivery date.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">16. In case of delivery to a pick-up point, the online store delivers the package to a so-called Foxpost Automata or Packeta Parcel Point or other pick-up point. After delivery, the customer will receive a notification by e-mail and SMS, after which the package can be picked up at the selected pick-up point within 3 working days. The Web Store stores the products already ordered (thereby reserved) in stock or received after purchase for a maximum of 3 working days. The Webstore cannot provide the possibility for the ordered products to be stored for longer than 3 working days and therefore delivered later or collected in person. The opening hours of the customer service are included in the notice.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">17. The Web Store strives to meet the delivery deadline, but is not responsible if the above standard delivery time cannot be met. In the event of a possible delay, the Web Store endeavors, but is not obliged, to notify the customer.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">18. At the time of delivery (or personal collection), the customer must check the integrity of the package, the number of products, and sign the receipt. In case of damaged packaging, the error must be recorded in a report on site. It is also recommended to check the integrity of the product upon receipt, and in the case of a quantity shortage or damaged product, record the shortage or defects in a report on the spot. The customer can only accept the product with undamaged packaging at his own risk. In the absence of recording of the protocol, the possibilities for exercising the governing right of withdrawal, for quantitative objections, and for asserting warranty claims due to damaged products are limited in the case of contracts concluded between absent parties. Complaints due to quantity or damage can be accepted without concern if a video recording is made of the opening of the package, on which it is clearly visible in good quality that the package was unopened when the recording started (all sides of the package are recorded), and the recording records the entire package uncut content. If during delivery the delivery of the package is unsuccessful, the supplier leaves a notification of this fact and then attempts to deliver the package no more than once. Delivery is made every working day between 8:00 and 17:00. The customer is obliged to provide a delivery address and a telephone number where he can be reached during the above time interval.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">19. On the website, we provide information on the essential properties of the products that can be purchased in the descriptions of each product.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">20. Procedure in the event of an incorrect price:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">It is considered an obviously incorrect price:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">\\u2022 HUF 0 price,<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">\\u2022 a price reduced by a discount, but the discount is incorrectly indicated (eg: in the case of a HUF 1,000 product, a product offered for HUF 100 with a 50% discount).<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">In the case of an incorrect price, the Service Provider offers the possibility of purchasing the product at the real price, with which information the Customer can decide whether to order the product at the real price or cancel the order without any adverse legal consequences.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">III. Warranty<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">1. In the case of a warranty, during its duration, the Operator is obliged to pay for defective performance according to the conditions contained in the legal declaration or legislation creating the warranty. The warranty does not affect the User\'s legal rights (such as those relating to accessories warranty). The Operator is released from the warranty obligation if it proves that the cause of the defect arose after performance. 151\\/2003 on the mandatory warranty for certain consumer durables sold under a contract concluded with a consumer. (IX. 22.) New durable consumer goods listed in Annex No. 1 of Government Decree are covered by a warranty obligation, the duration of which is one year. The warranty claim can be asserted within the warranty deadline, failure to meet the deadline results in loss of rights.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">If the Operator complies with the 151\\/2003. (IX. 22.) sells a product listed in Annex 1 of Government Decree No. 1 of new consumer durables, the warranty rules according to the above Government Decree apply to that product.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">In addition to the above obligation, the Operator undertakes a 3-year warranty for the products belonging to the product groups below: Battery chargers<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">1. Accessories warranty:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">a) In the event of defective performance of the business, you can assert a warranty claim against the business in accordance with the rules of the Civil Code.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">b) You - at your choice - can make use of the following accessory warranty claims:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">c) You can request a repair or replacement, unless the fulfillment of the request you choose is impossible or would involve disproportionate additional costs for the company compared to the fulfillment of another request. If you did not or could not ask for the repair or replacement, you can request a proportional reduction of the compensation or you can repair the defect at the expense of the company, or you can have it repaired by someone else or - in the last case - you can also withdraw from the contract.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">d) You can transfer from your selected accessory warranty right to another, but you will bear the cost of the transfer, unless it was justified or the company provided a reason for it.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">e) You are obliged to report the error immediately after its discovery, but no later than within two months from the discovery of the error. At the same time, I would like to draw your attention to the fact that you can no longer assert your accessory warranty rights beyond the two-year limitation period from the completion of the contract.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">f) You can enforce your accessory warranty claim against the company.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">g) There is no other condition for asserting your accessory warranty claim within six months from the date of delivery, apart from reporting the defect, if you prove that the product or service was provided by the company. However, after six months have passed since the performance, you are already obliged to prove that the defect you recognized was already present at the time of performance.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">2. Product warranty<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">a) In the event of a defect in a movable thing (product), you may - at your choice - enforce your right specified in point 1 or a product warranty claim.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">b) As a product warranty claim, you may only request the repair or replacement of the defective product.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">c) The product is defective if it does not meet the quality requirements in force at the time it is placed on the market or if it does not have the properties described by the manufacturer.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">d) You can assert your product warranty claim within two years of the product being placed on the market by the manufacturer. After this deadline, you will lose this right.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">e) You may only exercise your product warranty claim against the manufacturer or distributor of the movable item. You must prove the defect of the product in the event of a product warranty claim.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">f) Under what circumstances is the manufacturer (distributor) exempt from product warranty obligations<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">g) The manufacturer (distributor) is only released from its product warranty obligation if it can prove that:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">the product was not manufactured or marketed as part of its business activities, or<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">the defect was not detectable according to the state of science and technology at the time of placing it on the market or<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">the defect of the product results from the application of legislation or mandatory official regulations.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">h) It is sufficient for the manufacturer (distributor) to prove one reason for the exemption.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">i) I would like to draw your attention to the fact that due to the same defect, you cannot assert a claim for accessory warranty and product warranty at the same time, in parallel with each other. However, if your product warranty claim is successfully asserted, you can assert your accessory warranty claim for the replaced product or repaired part against the manufacturer.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">ARC. The right to withdraw from the purchase<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">45\\/2014 on distance contracts, the customers of the Webstore are entitled as consumers. (II.26.) Right of withdrawal according to government decree, which can be exercised within 14 calendar days after receiving the product.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">The consumer also has the right to cancel during the period between the date of conclusion of the contract and receipt of the product.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">The Consumer may not exercise his right of withdrawal or termination with respect to the following products sold by the Operator or services provided:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">in the case of a contract for the provision of services, after the completion of the service as a whole, if the Operator has started the performance with the express, prior consent of the Consumer, and the Consumer has acknowledged that he loses his right of termination after the completion of the service as a whole;<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">with regard to a product or service whose price or fee depends on the possible fluctuation of the money market, even during the 14-day withdrawal period, which cannot be influenced by the Operator;<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">in the case of a non-pre-manufactured product that was produced by the Operator on the basis of the Consumer\'s instructions or at his express request, or in the case of a product that was clearly tailored to the User;<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">regarding a perishable product or a product that retains its quality for a short time;<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">with regard to a product with closed packaging that cannot be returned after being opened after delivery for reasons of health protection or hygiene;<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">with regard to a product which, due to its nature, is inseparably mixed with another product after delivery.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">In the case of products that are not subject to the above restrictions, the buyer may withdraw from the contract within fourteen (14) days after receiving the product (or if the product has not yet been received on the day of the conclusion of the contract) without reason. In the case of a written cancellation, it shall be considered validated within the deadline if the buyer sends his cancellation statement before the deadline expires.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">In the event of cancellation, the customer must return the product to the Webstore in an unopened or disassembled state within 14 days of notification of cancellation. The deadline is considered to have been met if the customer proves that he sent the product to the post office or delivered it to a courier service by the last day of the deadline. The Web store will not accept a product returned by cash on delivery.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">as intended , the Web Store is obliged to refund the full purchase price to the customer. The Web Store may demand compensation from the consumer for damages resulting from improper use of the products. It is not possible to try the liquids sold in the Webstore, after the liquids (flavors) have been opened, there is no possibility to withdraw from the above, considering that the use of the liquids sold in the Webstore ceases after opening, the liquids are considered perishable.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">The customer can report a request for cancellation by email. The buyer can also communicate his intention to withdraw by means of the sample declaration in the annex to the Government Decree, or by his clear statement to that effect.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Withdrawal\\/Cancellation declaration form<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">(fill in and return only in case of intention to withdraw\\/terminate the contract)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Addressee:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">I\\/ we, the undersigned , declare that I\\/we exercise my\\/our right of withdrawal\\/termination with respect to the contract for the sale of the following product( s) or the provision of the following service:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Date of conclusion of contract \\/ date of acceptance:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Name of the consumer(s):<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Address of the consumer(s):<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Signature of the consumer(s): (only in the case of a statement made on paper)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Dated\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026 \\u2026\\u2026. .<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">The withdrawal based on this legislation does not need to be justified.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">In case of cancellation, the costs of returning the product are borne by the customer. The customer will not be charged any other costs.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">If the Consumer withdraws from the contract, we will refund the purchase price of the product immediately, but no later than within 14 days of receiving the Consumer\'s withdrawal statement, in the manner chosen by the buyer. The refund also applies to the delivery costs of the product to the customer, unless other products were delivered together with the product affected by the cancellation, in respect of which the customer did not exercise his right of cancellation, or unless the consumer does not choose the least expensive, standard mode of transport requested a different transport, in this case the Web Store is not obliged to reimburse the additional costs. However, our online store has the right to withhold the refund until we have received the product back, or the Consumer has not proven creditworthy that he has returned it: in this case, our online store will consider the earlier of the two dates.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">The costs of returning the returned product to the Webstore are borne by the customer. If the customer does not notify and exercise his right of withdrawal in accordance with these GTC and the law, the Webstore will not refund the purchase price, however - after prior consultation - it is possible to return the product to the customer. The costs of this redelivery are borne by the customer. The exercise of the right of withdrawal applies to consumers. The online store regulates the return option in the framework of a separate agreement with its wholesale and reseller partners .<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">If you have any questions regarding the exercise of the right of withdrawal, please contact our customer service for further information at our contact details at the beginning of the General Terms and Conditions. 45\\/2014 on the exercise of the right of withdrawal. (II.26) You can read the text of the Government Decree here:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">http:\\/\\/net.jogtar.hu\\/jr\\/gen\\/hjegy_doc.cgi?docid=A1400045.KOR<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Exchange:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">1. Within 14 days of receiving the product, the customer has the right to personally return the unused product in its original, undamaged and unopened packaging, as well as handing over the original invoice, to the Operator\'s premises.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">2. The Webstore will take back the product that complies with the previous conditions in all respects and calculate the total amount of the purchase price of the product on the invoice into the purchase price of another product or products chosen by the customer. If the purchase price of the selected other product or products is lower than the product affected by the intended purchase, in this case there is no way to refund the difference.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">3. The Web Store reserves the right to reject the application of the right of exchange contained in this point, if the right of exchange is not exercised in accordance with the provisions of these General Terms and Conditions or is otherwise abused . The Web Store also reserves the right to limit the right of exchange or to establish other conditions, as well as to suspend or terminate this possibility without justification, the relevant information of which will be published by amending the General Terms and Conditions. Purchases completed prior to the possible amendment will be assessed according to the provisions of the General Terms and Conditions in force at the time of the purchase, if it is more favorable for the customer.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">4. The right of exchange contained in this point does not affect the right of withdrawal due to the contract concluded between absent parties, which is due to the buyer, and neither the guarantee nor the warranty rights, they are valid without change.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">A. Limitation of Liability<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">1. Shopping in the Webstore assumes the customer\'s knowledge and acceptance of the possibilities and limitations of the Internet, with particular regard to technical performance and possible errors.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">2. The Webstore is not responsible in any way for the points listed below, for whatever reason:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Non-arrival or accidental change of any data sent and\\/or received on the Internet.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Any operational error in the internet network that prevents the online store from functioning and shopping.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Any failure in any receiving device on the communication lines.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Any unregistered or registered mail - regardless of whether it was received in paper or electronic form - but especially the loss of any data.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Malfunction of any software.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Symbol\\\">\\u00a7<\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Consequences of any program error, extraordinary event or technical error.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">3. The Webstore is not responsible on any basis for any direct or indirect damage that occurred as a result of connecting to the Webstore or viewing the Webstore.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">4. The user bears full and unlimited liability for damages resulting from the provision of another person\'s personal data or from publishing them in the Webshop. In such a case, the operator will provide all assistance to the acting authorities in order to establish the identity of the person violating the law.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">5. All users can use the public communication channels (e.g. writing product reviews) that are part of the Webstore at their own risk. The Web Store is not automatically moderated, however, if a notification or report is received regarding content that is infringing or injurious to interests, or becomes known to the operator in any other way, the operator is entitled to temporarily or permanently remove any content or part of it without justification. In case of repeated or serious violations of the law, the operator has the right to permanently exclude the user from using the site, including canceling his registration. In case of writing a product evaluation, the user acknowledges that the submitted product evaluation can be deleted or published by the Webstore without being asked. By submitting the product evaluation, the user consents to the appearance of his user name linked to the product evaluation.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">VI. Copyright<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">1. The copyright of all content (text, articles, product descriptions, information, these GTC, etc., graphics, images, other information and data) on the Webstore page belongs to the operator of the Webstore without spatial and temporal restrictions, unless otherwise specified. In particular, it is forbidden to use content downloaded from the Webstore for purposes other than shopping in the Webstore, to modify, copy, etc. In case of violation of copyright and other rights of the Webstore or breach of this contract, legal proceedings will be immediately initiated against the violator. By using the Web Store, the user accepts that copying the content of the page or using it for purposes other than those specified here constitutes a violation of the law (violation of these Terms and Conditions) even if it is not protected by copyright. The Web Store reserves the right to initiate proceedings before courts or authorities against any person who commits or attempts to violate the law by using the Web Store (including purchases). The Web Store cannot be held responsible for any infringement committed by a third party at the expense of a user or customer.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">2. In the event of any violation of the law related to the use of the site or the violation of the Seller\'s interests, the operator of the Webstore is entitled to suspend the user\'s registration with immediate effect, delete his personal and other data, as well as his registration. The data may still be processed for the purposes of proceedings related to infringement or damage to interests. The Webstore is not obliged to notify the user of the above steps.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">3. The display of the Webshop or any part of it on another domain , for example as a frame application - as part of its own pages - is only possible with prior written permission.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">4. The website on which the link to the Online Store is placed must not give the impression that the operator of the Online Store recommends or supports the use or purchase of a service or product distributed or offered on that page. The linking website may not contain false information about the legal relationship between the Online Store, the linking website and the Online Store. The Webstore takes action against the use of any links to it that harm the reputation and interests of the Webstore.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">VII. Information on data management, Newsletter<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">1. The website\'s data management information can be found in a separate menu item on the website.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">2. Users have the option of subscribing to the Operator\'s newsletter during their registration and later when using the site. Subscription to the newsletter is voluntary. In case of subscription, the user expressly consents to the transmission of informative and specifically advertising content to the e-mail address provided by him at intervals determined by the Operator. The user can unsubscribe from the newsletter at any time in the \\\"Newsletter subscription and unsubscribe\\\" menu created for this purpose on the website, or by clicking on the \\\"Unsubscribe\\\" link at the end of each newsletter.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">3. Additional rules regarding the letter of credit are contained in the data management information indicated in point 1.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">IX. Complaints handling<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">1. The electronic mail address that can be used to report complaints and maintain contact is the same as the Operator\'s e-mail address.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">2. The customer can report his complaint to the Operator by e-mail. It is not considered a complaint if the customer requests information or a decision regarding the operation and activities of the Webstore.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">3. The Web Store examines the verbal complaint immediately and remedies it as necessary. If the customer does not agree with the handling of the complaint, or if it is not possible to immediately investigate the complaint, the Web Store will immediately record the complaint and its position on it, and hand over a copy of it to the customer. The Web Store shall respond to the complaint in writing within thirty days, unless otherwise provided by law. The complaint submitted in this way is assigned a unique identification number by the Webstore. The Webstore also attaches the minutes of the complaint to the response. The recorded complaint must contain the name and address of the complainant, a description of the complaint, as well as other data required by law. The company is obliged to justify its position rejecting the complaint, and also draws the customer\'s attention to the legal remedies.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">4. In the event of a consumer complaint, the competent conciliation body at the company\'s registered office may be contacted:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Budapest Conciliation Board<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Address: 1016 Budapest, Krisztina krt. 99. III. em. 310.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Mailing address: 1253 Budapest, Pf.: 10.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Telephone number: 06 (1) 488 21 31<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Fax number: 06 (1) 488 21 86<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">E-mail address: bekelteto.testulet@bkik.hu<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">5. You must keep a copy of the answer for five years and present it to the inspection authorities upon request.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">6. The minutes recorded by the Webstore contain the CLV of 1997 on consumer protection. data required by law.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">524\\/2013\\/EU of the European Parliament and of the Council of May 21, 2013 on the online settlement of consumer disputes and the amendment of Regulation (EC) 2006\\/2004 and Directive 2009\\/22\\/EC (Consumer Online Dispute Resolution Directive) Regulation (hereinafter referred to as the Regulation), the European Commission has created an online dispute resolution platform that can be used by both consumers and traders in the event of a consumer dispute between parties to an online sales or service contract.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">8. The scope of the decree directly extends to the trader established in the Union and based in Hungary involved in online sales or service contracts, if a consumer legal dispute arises in connection with the online sales or service contract concluded between him and the consumer. In the event of a cross-border consumer legal dispute, your dispute with an EU online store will be resolved free of charge and quickly in Hungary exclusively by the conciliation body operating under the Budapest Chamber of Commerce and Industry.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">9. To be able to use the online dispute resolution platform, you must first register in the European Commission\'s system.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\\">10. After registering in the European Commission system, you can access the online dispute resolution platform using the following link: http:\\/\\/ec.europa.eu\\/odr After loading the page, select the desired language, log in and follow the instructions on the page.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:8.0pt; margin-left:0cm\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\