le=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">In any case, if the Data Controller intends to use the Personal Data for a purpose other than the purpose of the original data collection, the User shall be informed of this, and the User\'s prior express consent shall be obtained, and the User shall be given the opportunity to prohibit the use.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The data manager does not check the Personal data provided to him. The person providing the personal data is solely responsible for the adequacy of the personal data provided.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The data of a person under the age of 18 cannot be processed. The data controller is unable to verify the authorization of the consenting person or the content of his statement, so the User or the person exercising parental supervision over him guarantees that the consent complies with the law.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller\'s systems may collect data on the Users\' activity, which cannot be linked to other data provided by the Users during registration, nor to data generated when using other websites or services.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">In contrast to this, if the User consents to the Data Controller sending or publishing a marketing offer (EDM, customized banners, displays ), the User accepts that the data collected about the User\'s activity within the framework of this service and solely for the purpose of providing the service will be collected by the User in the are linked with other Personal Data provided during registration.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"6\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller does not hand over the Personal data it manages to third parties other than the Data Processors specified in this Notice, as well as, in some cases referred to in this Notice, the External Service Providers.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">An exception to the provision contained in this point is the use of data in a statistically aggregated form, which may not contain any other data suitable for the identification of the concerned User in any form, and therefore does not qualify as Data Management or data transmission.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">In certain cases - due to official court or police inquiry, legal proceedings, copyright, property \\u00ador other violations or due to reasonable suspicion of such, the Data Controller\'s interests are harmed, the provision of the service is jeopardized, etc. - makes the available Personal data of the concerned User accessible to third parties.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller, its Data Processors listed in this Notice, and the External Service Providers for their part, record, manage, or are processed and a statement is made to the Data Controller.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"7\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller on the correction, restriction, or of its deletion, it notifies the concerned User and all those to whom the Personal Data was previously transmitted for the purpose of Data Management. The notification may be omitted if this does not violate the legitimate interests of the User in view of the purpose of Data Management.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Given the relevant provisions of the GDPR, the Data Controller is not obliged to appoint a data protection officer, as it is not a public authority or a body performing a public task, its activities do not include any operations that require regular and systematic, large-scale monitoring of Users, and it does not handle special data or Personal data related to decisions regarding the determination of criminal liability and crimes.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller handles Personal Data in accordance with the applicable laws. In particular, the legislation governing Data Management:<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<ul>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">CXII of 2011 on the right to information self-determination and freedom of information. law (hereinafter: \\\" Infotv .\\\");<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">XLVIII of 2008 on the basic conditions and certain limitations of economic advertising activity. law (hereinafter: \\\" Grtv .\\\");<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:0cm; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Regulation 2016\\/679 of the European Parliament and of the Council.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">CVIII of 2001 on certain issues of electronic commercial services and services related to the information society. law;<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">\\u00a7 169 of Act C of 2000 on accounting (regarding the preservation of receipts).<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ul>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"5\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/b><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The legal basis of Data Management<\\/span><\\/b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:0cm; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Taking into account the nature of the Data Controller\'s activities, the legal basis for Data Management is in all cases the Users\' voluntary, explicit consent based on adequate information <\\/span>based on Article 6 (1) point a) of the Data Protection Ordinance <img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">, and in the case of profiling, the User\'s appropriate information in accordance with the provisions of the GDPR. Users voluntarily contact the Data Controller, voluntarily register, and voluntarily use the Data Controller\'s services. In the absence of the Users\' consent, the Data Controller will only manage Personal Data if it is clearly authorized to do so by law.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"2\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">In some cases, the legal basis for Data Management is a statutory provision. The main legislation that also prescribes Data Management is in 4.9. legislation specified in point. If the User or the Job Advertiser pays a fee to the Data Controller, the Data Controller handles the data on the receipt in accordance with Act C of 2000 on accounting.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">In the case of Data Management based on consent, the User has the right to withdraw his consent at any time. Withdrawal of consent does not affect the legality of data processing based on consent prior to withdrawal.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">When the User accesses the Website, the Data Manager records the User\'s IP address in connection with the provision of the service, in view of the legitimate interest of the Data Manager and for the reason of the legal provision of the service (e.g. to filter out illegal use or illegal content), even without the User\'s separate consent.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Data transmission to the Data Processors specified in this Notice may be carried out without the User\'s separate consent. The release of personal data to third parties or authorities - unless the law provides otherwise - is only possible on the basis of a legally binding official decision or with the prior express consent of the User.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">When entering the e-mail address of any User and the Personal data provided during registration (e.g. user name, ID, password, etc.), the User assumes responsibility for the use of the provided e-mail address and the Personal data provided by the User. use services, and their use does not constitute a violation of law in any way. In view of this responsibility, any responsibility related to logins to a specified e-mail address and\\/or data shall be borne solely by the User who registered the e-mail address and entered the data.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The legal basis for the Data Management can be the essential legitimate interests of the Data Controller, in which case the Data Controller has completed and may continue to perform the interest assessment test in accordance with the relevant provisions of the GDPR, which confirms that the Data Management is necessary to enforce the legitimate interests of the Data Controller and that these interests are not benefited the rights and freedoms of the data subject that require the protection of personal data take precedence.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/b><a name=\\\"bookmark49\\\"><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">6. Purpose of Data Management<\\/span><\\/b><\\/a><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller processes Personal Data exclusively for specific purposes, in order to exercise rights and fulfill obligations. It meets the purpose of Data Management in all stages of Data Management. Personal data is collected and handled fairly and legally. The Data Controller strives to ensure that only such Personal Data is processed that is essential for the realization of the purpose of Data Management and suitable for achieving the goal. Personal data can only be processed in the amount and for the time necessary to achieve the <a name=\\\"bookmark51\\\">goal <\\/a>.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The purpose of Data Management is primarily the operation of the Website and the provision of the Data Controller\'s services. The Data Controller deals with the presentation of job offers and the promotion of job searches, primarily through the Website, so the purpose of the Data Management is to convey job offers to Users, and to convey potential employees to employers.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The purpose of Data Management carried out by the Data Controller in connection with the operation and provision of services of the Website:<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<ul>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:0cm; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Identification of the User;<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"