e:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Additional personal data is provided only with the prior and clear voluntary consent of the User.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">In the case of the User\'s consent to the sending of the Newsletter, the scope and source of the processed Personal Data are the same as those stated in paragraph 7.2.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">If the User has given his consent to send offers for direct business acquisition or marketing purposes (e.g. EDM, placing customized banners, displays ), the Data Controller - in addition to the above - manages the following Personal data from the following sources:<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<ul>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:0cm; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">when giving consent: personal data recorded by the user,<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">related to customer profiling: IP address identified during user registration and browsing, cookie ,<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">browsing data from a web data source.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span>[~nl~][~nt~]<ol start=\\\"6\\\">[~nl~][~nt~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The User has the option to register with their existing profile on a social networking site (Facebook, Google). In this case, the User selects the service whose profile he wishes to register with and enters the login name and password used on that page. After that, the Data Controller imports the data on the given social media page. The User can only register with his profile uploaded on another site if he consents to the Data Manager handling the data in the given profile.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ul>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"7\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal