:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller manages Personal Data solely on the basis of the User\'s data provision. The source of the Personal Data is therefore the User who provides the Personal Data during registration. The provision of Personal Data on the registration form is mandatory, unless the contrary is expressly stated.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">8.2. The User acknowledges that by completing the registration on the Website, he also consents to the processing of his Personal data provided during registration by the Data Controller in accordance with the provisions of this Notice, and the User\'s registration will thus be entered into the Data Controller\'s records. Furthermore, if the User consents to EDM being sent to him, the Data Controller also becomes entitled to process his Personal Data.<img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">8.3. The User provides the Personal Data independently, the Data Controller does not provide any mandatory guidelines in this regard, and does not impose content expectations. The User expressly consents to the processing of the Personal Data provided by him. The User is entitled to enter other data in his profile in addition to the Personal Data requested by the Data Controller, the legal basis for the processing of Personal Data in this case is also the User\'s voluntary consent.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">8.4. If the User registers for a promotion organized by the Data Controller (e.g. on Facebook ) and provides the Personal data requested there, he accepts the data management information related to the given promotion. In this case, by providing Personal Data, the User does not register on the Website, but consents to the processing of the Personal Data provided as specified in the promotion information.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"9\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/b><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Data management for advertising purposes, sending newsletters<\\/span><\\/b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Advertisements can be sent by post, by phone (including SMS) or by e-mail. The condition for sending the ad is always the consent of the User. The User may withdraw their consent at any time without giving reasons.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">If the User agrees, the Data Controller will contact the User at the provided contact details and send him a Newsletter or EDM .<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"10\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:0cm; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/b><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Data management related to prize games<\\/span><\\/b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller occasionally organizes sweepstakes, the purpose of which is to increase the number of registrations and refresh (update) registrations. Participation in the raffle is not tied to a bet payment or purchase, so the raffle is not a raffle that requires a license or notification.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ul>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span>[~nl~][~nl~][~nt~]<ol>[~nl~][~nt~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The legal basis for Data Management is the User\'s consent. If the User applies for the sweepstakes or registers to participate in the sweepstakes, he provides his Personal Data and consents to the processing of his Personal Data, in accordance with the provisions of this Information. The declaration of acceptance and the provision of data are considered consent. You can participate in the prize draw:<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">With a new registration. In this case, the person who registers during the specified period will participate in the prize draw.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">With purchase. By ordering product( s ) on the Website.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span>[~nl~][~nt~]<ol start=\\\"2\\\">[~nl~][~nt~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The purpose of Data Management is to conduct the prize draw, draw, inform the winners, and deliver the prizes.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">After the prize draw, the Data Manager will handle the User\'s data as specified in this Information.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ul>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"11\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1p