gAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/b><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Data security, getting to know Personal Data<\\/span><\\/b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span>[~nl~][~nl~][~nt~]<ol>[~nl~][~nt~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller ensures the security of the Personal Data it manages, takes all the technical and organizational measures and develops all the procedural rules that are necessary to enforce the governing legislation, data and privacy protection rules. The Data Controller protects Personal Data with appropriate measures against unauthorized access, alteration, transmission, disclosure, deletion or destruction, as well as against accidental destruction and damage, as well as against becoming inaccessible due to changes in the technology used.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller records the Personal data it manages in accordance with the applicable laws, ensuring that the Personal Data can only be seen by those employees and other persons acting in the Data Controller\'s sphere of interest (data processors) who need it in order to perform their duties and tasks. Personal data can only be accessed within the employee\'s organization by logging. The employees of the Data Controller carry out individual searches and individual operations on Personal data only at the request of the User, or in the event that this is necessary for the provision of the service.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">When determining and applying measures for the security of Personal Data, the Data Controller takes into account the current state of technology. The Data Controller chooses among several possible data management solutions the one that ensures a higher level of protection of Personal Data, unless it would represent a disproportionate difficulty.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">As part of its duties related to IT protection, the Data Controller ensures in particular:<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ul>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">About the measures ensuring protection against unauthorized access, including the protection of software and hardware devices, as well as physical protection (access protection, network protection);<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">About the measures that ensure the possibility of restoring data files, including regular backups and the separate, safe handling of copies (mirroring, backups);<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:0cm; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Protection of data files against viruses (virus protection);<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">About the physical protection of data files and the devices that carry them, including protection against fire damage, water damage, lightning strikes, and other elemental damage, as well as the reparability of damage caused by such events (archiving, fire protection).<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ul>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The employees and other persons acting on behalf of the Data Controller are obliged to securely store and protect the data carriers that they use or own that contain Personal Data, regardless of the method of recording the Personal Data, against unauthorized access, alteration, transmission, disclosure, deletion. or destruction and against accidental destruction and damage.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller operates the electronic register using an IT program that meets the requirements of data security. The program ensures that only those persons who need it in order to perform their duties have access to the Personal Data under controlled conditions.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"16\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/b><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Duration of Data Management<\\/span><\\/b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span>[~nl~][~nl~][~nt~]<ol>[~nl~][~nt~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller deletes Personal Data if<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nt~]<\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol style=\\\"list-style-type:lower-alpha\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">handling is illegal;<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">If it turns out that the Personal Data is being processed illegally, the Data Controller will immediately execute the deletion.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"list-style-type:lower-alpha\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">requested by the User (with the exception of data management based on legislation);<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The User may request the deletion of Personal Data processed on the basis of the User\'s voluntary consent. In this case, the Data Controller will delete the Personal Data. Deletion can only be refused if the law authorizes the processing of Personal Data. In all cases, the concerned Data Controller provides information on the refusal of the deletion request and on the legislation enabling Data Management.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"3\\\" style=\\\"list-style-type:lower-alpha\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">the Personal Data is incomplete or incorrect - and this state cannot be legally remedied - provided that deletion is not precluded by law;<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">the purpose of Data Management has ceased or the statutory period for storing Personal Data has expired;<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Deletion may be refused (i) for the purpose of exercising the right to freedom of expression and information, or (ii) if the law authorizes the processing of Personal Data; and (iii) to present, enforce and defend legal claims.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">In all cases, the Data Controller informs the User of the refusal of the deletion request, indicating the reason for the refusal of the deletion. After fulfilling the request to delete personal data, the previous ( deleted ) data can no longer be restored.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Newsletters sent by the Data Controller can be unsubscribed via the unsubscribe link in them. In case of automatic unsubscription from the Newsletter, the Data Controller unsubscribes the User from the Newsletter sending service from which the unsubscription took place. If a User has subscribed to several Newsletters, the others will remain valid, until he initiates his intention to unsubscribe from several Newsletters or clearly indicates to the Data Controller his request to be deleted from the database. In this case, the Data Controller will delete all Personal Data of the User from the Newsletter database.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Since the Data Manager provides a continuous service to the User, the relationship between the parties is not subject to a time limit. Based on all of this - in the absence of the User\'s request - the Data Manager manages the data as long as the relationship between the Data Manager and the User exists and as long as the Data Manager can provide services to the User.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">All other Personal Data will be deleted by the Data Controller if it is clear that the Personal Data will not be used in the future, i.e. the purpose of the Data Management has ceased.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"5\\\" style=\\\"list-style-type:lower-alpha\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">it was ordered by the court or the National Data Protection and Freedom of Information Authority<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">If a court or the National Data Protection and Freedom of Information Authority legally orders the deletion of Personal Data, the deletion will be carried out by the Data Controller.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Instead of deletion, the Data Controller - after informing the User - locks the Personal Data if the User requests this or if, based on the information available, it can be assumed that the deletion would harm the User\'s legitimate interests. Personal data locked in this way can only be processed as long as the data management purpose that precluded the deletion of the Personal data exists. The Data Controller marks the Personal data it manages if the User disputes its correctness or accuracy, but the incorrectness or inaccuracy of the disputed Personal Data cannot be clearly established.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">In the case of Data Management ordered by law, the deletion of Personal Data is governed by the provisions of the law.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">In the event of deletion, the Data Controller renders the Personal Data unsuitable for personal identification. If required by law, the Data Controller destroys the data carrier containing the Personal Data.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"17\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/b><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Users\' rights and their enforcement<\\/span><\\/b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The Data Controller informs the User about the handling of Personal Data at the same time as the contact is made. The User is also entitled to request information about Data Management at any time.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Upon the User\'s request, the Data Controller provides information about the User\'s Personal Data managed by the User or processed by the data processor commissioned by the User or at its disposal, their source, the purpose, legal basis, duration of the Data Processing, the name and address of the data processor and the activities related to the Data Processing, the data protection incident its circumstances, effects and the measures taken to prevent it, and - in the case of forwarding the User\'s Personal data - the legal basis and recipient of the data forwarding. The Data Controller is obliged to provide the information in writing at the User\'s request in a form that is understandable to the public as soon as possible, but no later than 25 days after the submission of the request. Information is provided free of charge if the person requesting information has not yet submitted an information request for the same data set in the current year. In other cases, reimbursement may be established. The compensation already paid must be refunded if the data was handled unlawfully or the request for information led to a correction.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"2\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The User may request that the Data Controller correct his\\/her personal data that is entered incorrectly. In the event that regular data is provided on the basis of the Personal Data to be corrected, the Data Controller shall, if necessary, inform the recipient of the data provision of the correction.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The User may request the deletion of his Personal Data, with the exception of Data Management prescribed by law. The 12 Data Manager informs the User about the deletion.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The User may object to the handling of his Personal Data as defined in Infotv .<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The User\'s request for information, correction, or deletion may be submitted in writing, in a letter addressed to the Data Controller\'s headquarters or location, or by e-mail sent to the Data Controller\'s address specified in point 3 above of this Notice.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The User may request that the processing of his Personal Data be restricted by the Data Controller if the User disputes the accuracy of the Personal Data being processed. In this case, the limitation applies to the period that allows the Data Controller to verify the accuracy of the Personal Data. The Data Controller marks the Personal data it manages if the User disputes its correctness or accuracy, but the incorrectness or inaccuracy of the disputed Personal Data cannot be clearly established.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The User may request that the processing of his Personal Data be restricted by the Data Controller even if the Data Processing is illegal, but the User opposes the deletion of the processed Personal Data and instead requests a limitation of its use.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Furthermore, the User may also request that the Data Controller restricts the processing of his\\/her Personal Data if the purpose of the Data Processing has been achieved, but the User requires their processing by the Data Controller for the submission, enforcement or defense of legal claims.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"7\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The User may request that the Data Controller hand over the Personal Data provided by the User and processed by the User in an automated manner in a segmented, widely used, machine-readable format and\\/or forward them to another data controller.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">If the Data Controller does not comply with the User\'s request for correction, blocking or deletion, within 25 days of receiving the request, the Data Controller shall notify the reasons for rejecting the request for correction, blocking or deletion in writing. In case of rejection of the request for correction, deletion or blocking, the Data Controller informs the User of the possibility of a judicial remedy, as well as the possibility of turning to the National Data Protection and Freedom of Information Authority.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The User can make the above declarations related to the exercise of his rights at the contact details of the Data Controller listed in point 3 above.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">The User can complain directly to the National Data Protection and Freedom of Information Authority (address: 1125 Budapest, Szil\\u00e1gyi Erzs\\u00e9bet fasor 22\\/c.; phone: +36-1-391-1400; e-mail: <\\/span><a href=\\\"mailto:ugyfelszolgalat@naih.hu\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#0563c1\\\">ugyfelszolgalat@naih.hu <\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">; website: <\\/span><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.naih.hu\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#0563c1\\\">www. naih.hu <\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">) too.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">In case of violation of the User\'s legitimate rights, Infotv . to go to court on the basis of \\u00a7 22, paragraph (1). The adjudication of the lawsuit falls within the jurisdiction of the court. According to the User\'s choice, the lawsuit can also be initiated before the court of the User\'s place of residence or residence. Upon request, the Data Controllers will inform the User in detail about the possibility and means of legal redress.<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>[~nl~]<\\/ol>[~nl~][~nl~]<ol start=\\\"18\\\">[~nl~][~nt~]<li style=\\\"margin-bottom:5.0pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\"><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><img alt=\\\"Horgony\\\" src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAABlBMVEX\\/\\/\\/8AAABVwtN+AAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAFiS0dEAf8CLd4AAAAEZ0lGZwAAAAp8We1TAAAADGNtUFBKQ21wMDcxMgAAAAdPbbelAAAACklEQVQY02NgAAAAAgABmGNs1wAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\\\" style=\\\"width:1px; height:1px\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/b><b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10.0pt\\\">Modification of the General Data Management Notice<\\/span><\\/b><span lang=\\\"EN\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: